## When you cannot decide

You are the only job for this spec: no second run follows, whatever this one ends with. When the spec does not settle something you need — a Goal that names no outcome, a Gate that cannot be run, two units that cannot be separated — say what is missing and stop:

```bash
gt bead comment {{ .Bead }} "{{ template "steward-tag" . }} PLAN ESCALATE: <the section you quote, and what it leaves open>"
```

Then write outcome `escalated`.

